, "pos": [973.239013671875, -148.11978149414062], "id": 5, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "GenerationParameters"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "music", "links": [14], "label": "music", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "music"}], "size": [264.85986328125, 146], "pos": [985.5656127929688, -430.90118408203125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "prompt", "link": 20, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "lyrics", "link": 11, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"name": "parameters", "link": 12, "label": "parameters", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "parameters"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "ACEStepGen", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ACEStepGen"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [315, 112], "pos": [1355.798095703125, -423.41485595703125], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 14, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["ACE-Step 参数表中文对照解释\n1. 基础参数\n参数名 (英文)\t值\t中文解释\naudio_duration\t204\t音频时长（单位可能是秒或采样帧数，需根据系统确认具体含义）\ninfer_step\t60\t推理步数（数值越高，生成质量可能更精细，但计算时间更长）\nguidance_scale\t15.0\t引导强度（控制生成结果与输入条件的匹配度，值越大，AI 越严格遵循提示）\n2. 调度与算法\n| scheduler_type | euler | 调度器类型：欧拉（Euler）方法，用于控制生成过程中的噪声衰减节奏 |\n| cfg_type | apg | 算法类型：APG（可能指某种预测-梯度优化方法，用于稳定生成过程） |\n| omega_scale | 10.0 | 频率缩放因子（可能影响音高或节奏的调整幅度） |\n| seed | 3058990169 | 随机种子（固定此值可确保每次生成结果一致） |\n\n3. 控制与条件\n| control_after_generate | fixed | 生成后控制模式：固定（可能指参数在生成后不再调整） |\n| guidance_interval | 0.50 | 引导作用的时间间隔比例（例如 50% 的时间段内生效） |\n| guidance_interval_decay | 0.00 | 引导强度衰减率（0.00 表示不随时间减弱） |\n| min_guidance_scale | 3 | 最小引导强度（确保 AI 不会完全自由发挥） |\n\n4. 额外条件控制\n| use_erg_tag | true | 启用标签条件（如风格、歌手等标签会影响生成） |\n| use_erg_lyric | true | 启用歌词条件（歌词内容可能影响旋律或节奏） |\n| use_erg_diffusion | true | 启用扩散模型条件（可能涉及更复杂的音频生成优化） |\n| oss_steps | (空) | 可能指优化步骤（未设置具体值） |\n\n5. 文本与歌词引导\n| guidance_scale_text | 0.0 | 文本引导强度（0.0 表示未启用文本条件控制） |\n| guidance_scale_lyric | 0.0 | 歌词引导强度（0.0 表示歌词不影响生成） |\n\n关键点总结\n无直接性别参数，但 use_erg_tag 若包含歌手性别标签（如 female_vocal），可能间接影响音色。\n\n固定随机种子（seed）可确保实验可复现。\n\n高引导强度（guidance_scale=15.0）意味着 AI 会严格遵循输入条件（如提示词）。\n\n如需调整性别或风格，建议在输入标签或提示词中明确指定（例如 female_singer 或 pop_vocal）。\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [680.9541625976562, 433.7737121582031], "pos": [1300.5838623046875, -157.84518432617188], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.19.1", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [86.85839203962212, 708.8176343595984], "scale": 0.7972024500000007}}, "groups": [], "links": [[11, 1, 0, 8, 1, "STRING"], [12, 5, 0, 8, 2, "STRING"], [14, 8, 0, 9, 0, "AUDIO"], [20, 17, 0, 8, 0, "STRING"], [21, 2, 0, 17, 0, "STRING"], [24, 17, 0, 20, 0, "*"]], "id": "28f25528-b30c-4a0b-8573-f1c7b98cc10b", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 20, "revision": 0}